  "prompt": "# Core Summary\nA cinematic 15-second game CG sequence featuring a colossal Magma Titan executing a devastating ground slam in a volcanic wasteland. The clip follows a high-intensity dramatic arc: establishing scale with a low-angle approach, revealing the weapon detail, building tension during the wind-up, delivering a high-speed impact, and concluding with a wide shockwave aftermath. The structure utilizes a 5-shot progression with dynamic, FPV-style virtual camera movements that weave through the action to maximize immersion and visual impact.\n\n# Scene\n[shot1][00:00-00:03]\nVolcanic wasteland environment. Ground consists of jagged, obsidian-black rock plates with deep fissures. Bright orange molten lava flows slowly within the cracks, emitting a strong glow. Air is thick with dark volcanic ash and heat haze. Low angle perspective near the ground.\n**Audio Description**: Deep, sub-bass tectonic rumbling. Hissing steam from cooling lava. Heavy, rhythmic footsteps shaking the audio field.\n\n[shot2][00:03-00:06]\nClose-up environment around the Titan's hand. Background is blurred dark rock and fire. Focus is on the weapon and hand interaction. Lighting is dominated by the emissive glow of the magma on the weapon.\n**Audio Description**: Sound of grinding stone and flowing liquid fire. High-pitched crackling of sparks.\n\n[shot3][00:06-00:10]\nMid-range environment showing the Titan's upper body against a backdrop of rising volcanic smoke. Air distortion is visible due to extreme heat. Lighting intensifies on the weapon as it charges.\n**Audio Description**: Rising tension sound, like pressure building. Low frequency hum increasing in volume.\n\n[shot4][00:10-00:13]\nImpact zone environment. Ground surface rushing towards camera. Dust and debris particles fill the air. Lighting shifts to a blinding flash at the moment of contact.\n**Audio Description**: High-speed wind whoosh. Massive explosive impact sound. Bass drop.\n\n[shot5][00:13-00:15]\nWide aerial view of the crater. Circular shockwave expanding across the dark terrain. Sky is choked with red smoke and falling embers. Volumetric light rays pierce through the dust cloud.\n**Audio Description**: Echoing explosion decay. Roaring fire wind. Fading rumble.\n\n# Subjects Description\n<ID_A> (Magma Titan)\n- *Gender*: Male archetype.\n- *Race/Ethnicity*: Elemental Construct (Rock/Magma).\n- *Age*: Ancient.\n- *Appearance features*: Colossal humanoid figure composed of jagged black obsidian rock. Glowing orange magma flows through cracks in the skin. Massive muscular build. Wields a gigantic war hammer made of dark metal and encrusted with cooling lava. No facial features, only a burning fissure where a face would be.\n- *Vocal Characteristics*: Deep, resonant, non-verbal roaring sounds like grinding tectonic plates.\n\n# Dynamic Narrative\n[shot1][00:00-00:03]\nDynamic Virtual Camera skims just inches above the cracked black earth, moving forward rapidly (FPV style). <ID_A>'s massive legs stride heavily in the background, feet crushing rocks. The camera weaves between fissures of glowing orange magma. The ground shakes visibly with each step <ID_A> takes. Camera tilts up slightly at the end to reveal the lower torso of the titan looming ahead.\n**Sound**: Heavy stone footsteps impact sync with camera shake. Magma bubbling sounds.\n\n[shot2][00:03-00:06]\n[cut to] Camera whips rapidly around to the front, closing in on <ID_A>'s right hand. <ID_A> grips the handle of a massive war hammer. Molten rock flows like veins across the hammer head, glowing brighter. Sparks fly off the metal surface towards the lens. Camera focuses sharply on the texture of cooling black rock and liquid fire.\n**Sound**: Metal grinding against stone. Sharp hissing of heat.\n\n[shot3][00:06-00:10]\n[cut-out] Camera pulls back quickly to a medium-wide shot. <ID_A> leans back, shifting center of gravity, raising the hammer high for a strike. Muscles (rock plates) shift and grind. Air around the hammer shimmers with intense heat haze. The magma on the hammer flares intensely bright orange. Camera tracks slightly backward to maintain framing as the hammer rises.\n**Sound**: Deep inhale sound (wind). Tectonic grinding intensifies.\n\n[shot4][00:10-00:13]\n[cut to] Camera attaches virtually to the hammer head. View rushes downward at extreme speed as <ID_A> slams the weapon into the ground. Motion blur increases. The ground rushes up to fill the frame. Upon impact, the screen shakes violently, and a burst of lava and debris obscures the view momentarily.\n**Sound**: Sonic boom. Massive explosion. Crashing earth.\n\n[shot5][00:13-00:15]\n[cut-out] Camera emergency stops at ground level then shoots vertically upward. A circular shockwave of fire and dust expands outward from the impact point. <ID_A> stands silhouetted in the center amidst rising smoke. Golden embers float like snow in the air. Light rays penetrate the smoke cloud as the scene stabilizes.\n**Sound**: Roaring fire wind. Distant crumbling. Fade to silence.\n\n# Style, Color & Aesthetics\n- **Visual Style**: Hollywood-tier Game CG (Unreal Engine 5 style). Hyper-realistic textures with stylized lighting.\n- **Color Palette**: Dominant Black (obsidian), Orange (magma), Red (glow), Dark Grey (ash). High contrast chiaroscuro lighting.\n- **Lighting**: Emissive lighting from lava sources. Volumetric fog and god rays. Heat distortion effects (refraction) around hot objects.\n- **Texture**: Rough, jagged rock surfaces contrasted with fluid, viscous liquid lava. Metallic sheen on the hammer.\n- **Image Quality**: Sharp focus on action points, cinematic motion blur on fast movements. No grain, clean digital look.\n\n# Atmosphere & Emotion\n- **Atmosphere**: Oppressive, intense, apocalyptic. The air feels thick with heat and danger.\n- **Emotion**: Awe-inspiring power, primal fear, destructive force. The pacing drives a sense of inevitable doom followed by catastrophic release.",
